  "purpose": "qwen-tp8/coll4 clock-root split of the TP4 io_collective: qfd_io_collective_rt (11.3k engine glue flops on one spine root, TT insertion 1.75 ns) failed EARLY_FAIL_HOLD FF -504.7 flat. MARGIN 9: the engine column datapath is 5 hardened ot_coll_col_tile leaves (coll_col_tile_rt, own CTS) next to the 4 fold slices; the cluster keeps ~0.6k control/output flops. Column-ordered physical top ot_coll_io_rt (pure wiring): in/rx per-row bands on W, tx/out per-row bands on E (die contract face change). +1 cycle tx, +1 cycle out.",
  "benches": [
